<title>GERMANY: Duerr details 96 results.</title>
<headline>Duerr details 96 results.</headline>
<dateline>BIETIGHEIM-BISSINGEN, Germany 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   23.9    vs n/a</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     36.2    down 18 pct</p>
<p>    Group cash flow (DVFA method)	  46.2    vs n/a</p>
<p>    Return on sales			    1.5 pct vs n/a</p>
<p>    Group sales			    1,640	 up 11 pct</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		1,786	 vs 1,610</p>
<p>    Group order book		     1,425	 up 13 pct</p>
<p>    Dividend				  1.20	 vs 1.20 marks</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German plant manufacturing group is Duerr AG. The group had reported some of its figures in January and will hold a news conference on 1996 results on Tuesday. The group also said that it expects a positive business development in 1997, after the year got off to a strong start in the first four months. From January to April orders totalled 657 million marks. The group also said it was confident about its profits for the ongoing year.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
